<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia April reserves reach $20.382 billion.</title>
<headline>Indonesia April reserves reach $20.382 billion.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesia's foreign exchange reserves rose to $20.382 billion at the end of April from $19.873 billion in March, a government official said on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;Indonesia's foreign reserves rose to $20.832 billion in April from $19.873 billion in March,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>Indonesia's foreign reserves totalled $19.862 billion in February and $19.830 billion in January.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
